+## Snapshots, trust score and emergency stop
+
+These guards work the same on every provider (Claude SDK, Codex, Copilot, OpenCode, pi, ACP agents, OpenAI, Google, compatible and local models) and every stack.
+
+- **Snapshots and rollback** — before each agent session (planning, coding, QA) the task's worktree is saved as a hidden git commit; ignored files (`node_modules`, `bin`, `obj`, `.venv`…) are not copied. The card of a paused task lists its snapshots and restores one after confirmation; the replaced state is kept as a snapshot too.
+- **Trust score** — each session starts at 100, and each anomaly lowers it: a path outside the project or into the system (−30), a mass deletion (−25), a dangerous command (−20), access to a secret or to the git history (−20), network access, a security configuration changed… At or below the pause threshold (40 by default) the task pauses and a notification says why; at or below the stop threshold (20) the session is stopped and its snapshot restored. The card shows the score and what lowered it.
+- **Restricted write mode** — the agent may write only the paths you list (the task's own files stay writable); limits per session cap the files written, the largest file and more.
+- **Circuit breaker** — an agent that makes the same tool call with the same arguments and gets the same result five times, without changing a file, is paused; the card names the tool.
+- **Stop all agents** — the red button at the foot of the menu while a task runs (Ctrl+Shift+.) pauses every running task, each resumed from its card.
+- **Cost budgets** — a project budget per period and a limit per task are checked before every agent session; the task pauses at its limit (« Raise and resume » on the card) and a task that spends without finishing a subtask is paused too.
+
+Settings: **Security & performance → Anomaly Detection** (thresholds and what lowers the score) and **Sandbox** (snapshots, write mode, limits). Design: [agent-safety.md](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/blob/develop/docs/architecture/agent-safety.md), [agent-kill-switch.md](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/blob/develop/docs/architecture/agent-kill-switch.md), [cost-budgets.md](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/blob/develop/docs/architecture/cost-budgets.md).
+
+![Sandbox settings](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/develop/.github/assets/screenshots/sandbox.png)
